# Annex A.5 - `h1Function`

**Location:** inside `GaussianTwoFactors.m`, inside `methods`.

```matlab
function h1 = h1Function(obj, yBar, muYCond, sigmaYCond)
    % Brigo h1:
    %
    %     h1(x) = (yBar(x) - E[Y|X=x]) / Std[Y|X=x]

    arguments
        obj (1,1) GaussianTwoFactors;
        yBar (1,1) double;
        muYCond (1,1) double;
        sigmaYCond (1,1) double {mustBeNonnegative};
    end

    if sigmaYCond <= 0
        error("sigmaYCond must be strictly positive.");
    end

    h1 = (yBar - muYCond) ./ sigmaYCond;
end
```

