# Annex A.7 - `kappaFunction`

**Location:** inside `GaussianTwoFactors.m`, inside `methods`.

```matlab
function kappa = kappaFunction(obj, By, muYCond, varYCond)
    % Brigo kappa_i(x):
    %
    %     kappa_i(x) = -By_i * muYCond + 0.5 * By_i^2 * varYCond

    arguments
        obj (1,1) GaussianTwoFactors;
        By (:,1) double;
        muYCond (1,1) double;
        varYCond (1,1) double {mustBeNonnegative};
    end

    By = By(:);

    kappa = -By .* muYCond + 0.5 .* (By.^2) .* varYCond;
end
```

